<section class="panel" aria-label="Grade 3 2021 first-party rounding lesson"><h2>Choral Count</h2><p>Count by 10 from 0 to 200 and by 100 from 0 to 900; explain the shared multiples.</p><h2>Round to nearest ten and hundred</h2><table class="source-chart"><thead><tr><th>Original source number</th><th>Nearest ten</th><th>Nearest hundred</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>18</td><td>20</td><td>0</td></tr>
