<tr><td>312</td><td>310</td><td>300</td></tr>
<tr><td>439</td><td>440</td><td>400</td></tr>
<tr><td>601</td><td>600</td><td>600</td></tr></tbody></table><p>At the midpoint the source uses a convention: <strong>415 -> 420</strong> to nearest ten and <strong>750 -> 800</strong> to nearest hundred. Distances tie; the convention selects the higher number.</p><h2>Round to Estimate</h2><p>Predict which rounded sum is greater, then add independently rounded school counts.</p><table class="source-chart"><thead><tr><th>Location</th><th>Original</th><th>Andre to 100</th><th>Lin to 10</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>playground</td><td>94</td><td>100</td><td>90</td></tr>
